INSERT INTO public.content_schedule (title, channel_label, scheduled_date, status, brand, body, cta, post_type, notes) SELECT 'Your county has its own rulebook. Do you know what''s in it?', 'Email', '2026-08-10', 'drafted', 'EvidLY', 'Two kitchens. Same menu, same equipment, same standards. Different counties — and two completely different sets of rules, evaluation methods, and inspection rhythms.

Most compliance advice ignores this entirely. It tells you what "the health department" wants, as if there''s one. There isn''t. There are 169 across the five states we cover, and each one evaluates you its own way.

Some publish a letter grade. Some publish a number. Some publish a pass/fail placard. Some publish nothing at all. The same violation carries different weight depending on which side of a county line your kitchen sits on. Inspection frequency differs. Risk-tier policies differ. What triggers a re-inspection differs.

EvidLY evaluates your kitchen against your county''s actual methodology — exactly what your authority produces, never a made-up blended number. Because a number that drifts from what your county actually does helps no one.

That''s clarity you can act on.

Every kitchen that runs right is a family that keeps its livelihood. That''s the why behind this.

Predict the lapse. Reduce the cost.

Arthur Haggerty
Founder, EvidLY
