INSERT INTO public.content_schedule (title, channel_label, scheduled_date, status, brand, body, cta, post_type, notes) SELECT '250 seats. No clock. Here''s where the window stands.', 'Email', '2026-08-13', 'drafted', 'EvidLY', 'The Founder window opened on the Fourth of July — America''s 250th birthday — and kitchen leaders have been claiming seats ever since.

What a Founder seat holds: $99 a month plus $49 per additional location, locked for 24 months. Setup is $250 plus $50 per additional location. After the 250 fill, that same coverage is $199 plus $99.

There is no countdown clock. No artificial deadline. The window closes when seat 250 is taken, and not a moment before. When they''re gone, they''re gone — and the 24-month lock goes with them.

You also get the multi-unit view at two or more locations, and a 45-day money-back guarantee. If it isn''t what we said it is, you get your money back.

First 250 for 250 Years of America.

If you''ve been meaning to see EvidLY with your own kitchen''s information, a tour takes about twenty minutes.

Predict the lapse. Reduce the cost.

Arthur Haggerty
Founder, EvidLY
