INSERT INTO public.content_schedule (title, channel_label, scheduled_date, status, brand, body, cta, post_type, notes) SELECT 'Food and Fire never blend. Here''s why that matters.', 'Email', '2026-08-17', 'drafted', 'EvidLY', 'Some systems will hand you a single compliance number. It looks tidy. It''s also fiction.

Food safety is governed by your county health department. Fire safety is governed by your fire authority. Different rules, different inspectors, different bodies of law, different consequences. Blending them into one figure hides the thing you most need to see: where exactly you''re exposed.

Here''s the practical version. Say you''re strong on food safety and weak on fire safety. Averaged together, you look fine. You are not fine — you have a serious exposure sitting underneath a comfortable number, and the number is what''s stopping you from finding it.

EvidLY keeps them separate. Always. Your food safety, evaluated against your county''s methodology. Your fire safety, evaluated against your fire authority''s. Two clear views, never mixed.

That separation is the whole point. You can''t reduce a risk you can''t see.

I built this so kitchen leaders would stop being surprised by the ordinary — and so the people on my team would have something durable to build careers on.

Predict the lapse. Reduce the cost.

Arthur Haggerty
Founder, EvidLY
