INSERT INTO public.content_schedule (title, channel_label, scheduled_date, status, brand, body, cta, post_type, notes) SELECT 'Your equipment tells you it''s failing. Months ahead.', 'Email', '2026-08-31', 'drafted', 'EvidLY', 'A walk-in doesn''t fail on a Tuesday out of nowhere. It drifts — a degree here, a longer recovery there, a compressor cycling more than it did last quarter. The signal is there for months.

Same with a fryer thermostat. Same with an exhaust fan bearing running warm. Same with a suppression system aging past its service interval.

The kitchens that get surprised aren''t careless. They just never had anything reading the signal.

That''s what EvidLY does. It identifies the pattern early enough that you''re scheduling a repair instead of absorbing an emergency service call, a spoilage loss, and an unplanned health department visit in the same week.

The cost difference between those two versions of the same failure is not small. One is a line item. The other is a bad month.

Every kitchen that runs right is a family that keeps its livelihood. That''s the why.

Predict the lapse. Reduce the cost.

Arthur Haggerty
Founder, EvidLY
