Multi-unit view at 2+ locations.
45-day money-back guarantee.

250 seats. No date — closes when they''re gone.', 'getevidly.com', 'LinkedIn — EvidLY', '[copy_state: Final] [source: EvidLY-LinkedIn]' WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM public.content_schedule c WHERE c.brand IS NOT DISTINCT FROM 'EvidLY' AND c.channel_label = 'LinkedIn' AND c.scheduled_date = '2026-08-21' AND c.title = 'What a Founder seat locks');
INSERT INTO public.content_schedule (title, channel_label, scheduled_date, status, brand, body, cta, post_type, notes) SELECT 'The fire was survivable. The denial wasn''t.', 'LinkedIn', '2026-08-24', 'drafted', 'EvidLY', 'I''ve seen a fully covered commercial kitchen loss turn into a denied claim because five documents didn''t exist in retrievable form.

Hood cleaning records. Suppression service history. Inspection history. Training logs. Photographic evidence of condition.

The kitchen had done the work. Most of it, anyway. What it couldn''t do was prove it on the day someone asked.

That''s a family''s livelihood, gone on paperwork. I think about that one a lot.', 'getevidly.com', 'LinkedIn — Arthur', '[copy_state: Final] [source: EvidLY-LinkedIn]' WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM public.content_schedule c WHERE c.brand IS NOT DISTINCT FROM 'EvidLY' AND c.channel_label = 'LinkedIn' AND c.scheduled_date = '2026-08-24' AND c.title = 'The fire was survivable. The denial wasn''t.');
INSERT INTO public.content_schedule (title, channel_label, scheduled_date, status, brand, body, cta, post_type, notes) SELECT 'Five documents decide most claims.', 'LinkedIn', '2026-08-26', 'drafted', 'EvidLY', 'Hood cleaning records · Suppression service history · Inspection history · Training logs · Photographic evidence.

Most kitchens have some. Few have all five, dated and retrievable in the moment it matters.

EvidLY keeps the proof where you can produce it.', 'getevidly.com', 'LinkedIn — EvidLY', '[copy_state: Final] [source: EvidLY-LinkedIn]' WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM public.content_schedule c WHERE c.brand IS NOT DISTINCT FROM 'EvidLY' AND c.channel_label = 'LinkedIn' AND c.scheduled_date = '2026-08-26' AND c.title = 'Five documents decide most claims.');
INSERT INTO public.content_schedule (title, channel_label, scheduled_date, status, brand, body, cta, post_type, notes) SELECT 'Why insurance is the sharpest lens on compliance', 'LinkedIn', '2026-08-27', 'drafted', 'EvidLY', 'Carriers have no incentive to be generous with definitions. When a claim is reviewed, the question isn''t whether you ran a good kitchen — it''s whether you can demonstrate it.

That''s a brutal standard. It''s also a clarifying one. If your documentation would survive a claim review, it will survive anything a health inspector or fire marshal brings.

So that''s the bar I build to.', 'getevidly.com', 'LinkedIn — Arthur', '[copy_state: Final] [source: EvidLY-LinkedIn]' WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM public.content_schedule c WHERE c.brand IS NOT DISTINCT FROM 'EvidLY' AND c.channel_label = 'LinkedIn' AND c.scheduled_date = '2026-08-27' AND c.title = 'Why insurance is the sharpest lens on compliance');
INSERT INTO public.content_schedule (title, channel_label, scheduled_date, status, brand, body, cta, post_type, notes) SELECT 'Founder seats are filling.', 'LinkedIn', '2026-08-28', 'drafted', 'EvidLY', '250 total. 24-month price lock. No countdown clock — the window closes when seat 250 is taken.

First 250 for 250 Years of America.', 'getevidly.com', 'LinkedIn — EvidLY', '[copy_state: Final] [source: EvidLY-LinkedIn]' WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM public.content_schedule c WHERE c.brand IS NOT DISTINCT FROM 'EvidLY' AND c.channel_label = 'LinkedIn' AND c.scheduled_date = '2026-08-28' AND c.title = 'Founder seats are filling.');
INSERT INTO public.content_schedule (title, channel_label, scheduled_date, status, brand, body, cta, post_type, notes) SELECT 'Equipment tells you. Months ahead.', 'LinkedIn', '2026-08-31', 'drafted', 'EvidLY', 'A walk-in doesn''t fail on a Tuesday out of nowhere. It drifts. A degree here. A longer recovery there. A compressor cycling more than it did last quarter.

The signal exists for months. What most kitchens lack is anything reading it.

That''s the difference between scheduling a repair and absorbing an emergency call, a spoilage loss, and an unplanned health department visit in the same week. One is a line item. The other is a bad month.', 'getevidly.com', 'LinkedIn — Arthur', '[copy_state: Final] [source: EvidLY-LinkedIn]' WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM public.content_schedule c WHERE c.brand IS NOT DISTINCT FROM 'EvidLY' AND c.channel_label = 'LinkedIn' AND c.scheduled_date = '2026-08-31' AND c.title = 'Equipment tells you. Months ahead.');
INSERT INTO public.content_schedule (title, channel_label, scheduled_date, status, brand, body, cta, post_type, notes) SELECT 'Prediction is a pattern, not a guess.', 'LinkedIn', '2026-09-02', 'drafted', 'EvidLY', 'Temperature drift. Recovery time. Cycling frequency. Service interval history.

EvidLY identifies the pattern early enough to act — so a repair is scheduled, not emergency-priced.', 'getevidly.com', 'LinkedIn — EvidLY', '[copy_state: Final] [source: EvidLY-LinkedIn]' WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM public.content_schedule c WHERE c.brand IS NOT DISTINCT FROM 'EvidLY' AND c.channel_label = 'LinkedIn' AND c.scheduled_date = '2026-09-02' AND c.title = 'Prediction is a pattern, not a guess.');
INSERT INTO public.content_schedule (title, channel_label, scheduled_date, status, brand, body, cta, post_type, notes) SELECT 'What I want the first 250 to know', 'LinkedIn', '2026-09-03', 'drafted', 'EvidLY', 'The first 250 kitchen leaders who join EvidLY aren''t just customers to me.

They''re the ones betting on something new because they believe the visibility gap shouldn''t exist — and because someone has to go first.

I''m a USAF veteran. Opening this window on the Fourth of July wasn''t a marketing gimmick. 250 seats for 250 years of this country.

I won''t forget who showed up first.', 'getevidly.com', 'LinkedIn — Arthur', '[copy_state: Final] [source: EvidLY-LinkedIn]' WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM public.content_schedule c WHERE c.brand IS NOT DISTINCT FROM 'EvidLY' AND c.channel_label = 'LinkedIn' AND c.scheduled_date = '2026-09-03' AND c.title = 'What I want the first 250 to know');
INSERT INTO public.content_schedule (title, channel_label, scheduled_date, status, brand, body, cta, post_type, notes) SELECT 'Month one of the Founder window', 'LinkedIn', '2026-09-04', 'drafted', 'EvidLY', '$99/month + $49 per additional location, locked 24 months. After 250: $199 + $99.

No date. It closes at seat 250.', 'getevidly.com', 'LinkedIn — EvidLY', '[copy_state: Final] [source: EvidLY-LinkedIn]' WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM public.content_schedule c WHERE c.brand IS NOT DISTINCT FROM 'EvidLY' AND c.channel_label = 'LinkedIn' AND c.scheduled_date = '2026-09-04' AND c.title = 'Month one of the Founder window');
INSERT INTO public.content_schedule (title, channel_label, scheduled_date, status, brand, body, cta, post_type, notes) SELECT 'Doing the work and proving it are different capabilities.', 'LinkedIn', '2026-09-07', 'drafted', 'EvidLY', 'Every kitchen leader I''ve met can describe how they run their kitchen.

Very few can demonstrate it — on demand, to someone skeptical, from records, without a week of preparation.

The first is competence. The second is what an inspector, a carrier, or a buyer actually evaluates.

And the gap between them is where good operations get hurt. A kitchen that did the work but can''t produce the evidence occupies the same position as one that didn''t.

That''s harsh. It''s also the actual standard, and pretending otherwise doesn''t help anyone.', '', 'LinkedIn — Arthur', '[copy_state: Final] [source: EvidLY-LinkedIn]' WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM public.content_schedule c WHERE c.brand IS NOT DISTINCT FROM 'EvidLY' AND c.channel_label = 'LinkedIn' AND c.scheduled_date = '2026-09-07' AND c.title = 'Doing the work and proving it are different capabilities.');
INSERT INTO public.content_schedule (title, channel_label, scheduled_date, status, brand, body, cta, post_type, notes) SELECT 'Predict. Reduce. Prove.', 'LinkedIn', '2026-09-09', 'drafted', 'EvidLY', 'Predict — identify what''s coming while there''s still time to choose your response.

Reduce — not prevent. Prevention isn''t available in a commercial kitchen. Reduction is.

Prove — demonstrate it, on demand, to someone skeptical.

Prediction without reduction is anxiety. Reduction without proof is invisible. Proof without the first two is theater.', 'getevidly.com', 'LinkedIn — company', '[copy_state: Final] [source: EvidLY-LinkedIn]' WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM public.content_schedule c WHERE c.brand IS NOT DISTINCT FROM 'EvidLY' AND c.channel_label = 'LinkedIn' AND c.scheduled_date = '2026-09-09' AND c.title = 'Predict. Reduce. Prove.');
INSERT INTO public.content_schedule (title, channel_label, scheduled_date, status, brand, body, cta, post_type, notes) SELECT 'Why I won''t use the word ''prevent.''', 'LinkedIn', '2026-09-10', 'drafted', 'EvidLY', 'It shows up in every competitor''s copy and it''s a promise nobody can keep.

You cannot prevent every lapse in a commercial kitchen. Equipment ages. People turn over. Conditions change. Anyone selling prevention is selling something that doesn''t exist, and the sale works because prevention is what customers want to hear.

Reduce is honest. Reduce probability. Reduce consequence. Reduce the number of failures that arrive without warning.

That''s achievable, it''s measurable, and when it doesn''t fully work, the customer isn''t holding a promise that was never real.

Small word. It matters.', '', 'LinkedIn — Arthur', '[copy_state: Final] [source: EvidLY-LinkedIn]' WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM public.content_schedule c WHERE c.brand IS NOT DISTINCT FROM 'EvidLY' AND c.channel_label = 'LinkedIn' AND c.scheduled_date = '2026-09-10' AND c.title = 'Why I won''t use the word ''prevent.''');
